        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LGN150SBR, 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Laguna Door Pull with Brass Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary wooden door pull can be made with your choice of different types of wood including cherry and white oak. This 1-1/2 Inch Wood Door Pull with Brass Mounts is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, 36 inch lengths. Since the brackets are made from solid brass, they can be finished in a huge array of colors. With 1-1/2 inch diameter, this Laguna Pull is great for heavier doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/1-inch-wood-door-pull-with-brass-mounts-first-impressions-lgn100sbr\"><b>1 Inch Wood Door Pull with Brass Mounts</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions LGN150SBR Laguna Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LGN02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262337\"><b>First Impressions LGN150SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LGN150018SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LGN150024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LGN150036SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Different Wood Types</b> and <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-1/2 Inch Diameter Laguna Door Pull",
                "description": "This contemporary wooden door pull can be made with your choice of different types of wood including cherry and white oak. This 1-1/2 Inch Wood Door Pull with Brass Mounts is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, 36 inch lengths. Since the brackets are made from solid brass, they can be finished in a huge array of colors. With 1-1/2 inch diameter, this Laguna Pull is great for heavier doors. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Wooden 1-1/2 Inch Laguna Door Pulls, 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Laguna Door Pull with Brass Mounts, First Impressions LGN02, FII-LGN02, wood door pulls, wood door handles, wood store front door handles, Laguna collection series 2 pulls, 1-1/2 Inch Wood Door Pull with Brass Mounts, First Impressions LGN02 Laguna Wood Door Handles, FII-LGN150SBR, First Impressions LGN150SBR,"
